\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front densification near the g limit; g should be about 11.96.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2db76eed0f16\",\"rationale\":\"Between -3.564 and -3.5702, in the last stretch before the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38523,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.567},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274480,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.11,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the corner region where T is lowest.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-105ca6c5af01\",\"rationale\":\"The g-limited corner with D raised from 3.3852 to 3.38523. It should dominate C-105ca6c5af01 by a hair if it stays feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38523,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5703},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274545,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.08,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the joint D and g limits at the corner. A higher-fidelity check is not needed.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-105ca6c5af01\",\"rationale\":\"Pushes gamma 0.0001 deg steeper than the current corner at D=3.3852. The g slack of ~0.00018 g suggests it is just feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5704},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274590,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.08,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes exactly where the g=12 boundary lies. A pass extends the front by a negligible amount, and a fail pins the limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1}]}","ttft_ms":139299,"type":"result","duration_ms":185282,"uuid":"cbba2669-c7a5-4e3b-a409-00b60e9fe62d","ttft_stream_ms":3488,"time_to_request_ms":55,"first_content_frame_ms":3489,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
